WEBVTT

01:29.310 --> 01:34.360
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.600 --> 01:37.780
[Episode 19]

01:43.759 --> 01:44.710
Will you stay?

01:50.180 --> 01:51.350
Can't it be me?

01:52.430 --> 01:53.960
Does it have to be Lu Xixiao?

01:55.020 --> 01:56.320
Can't it be me?

01:57.450 --> 01:58.759
Am I that bad?

02:03.480 --> 02:04.290
Jiang Yan.

02:05.110 --> 02:07.110
I've always treated you as a friend.

02:26.640 --> 02:28.060
Has something happened

02:28.930 --> 02:30.630
to you lately?

02:39.790 --> 02:41.300
I have my answer now.

02:46.120 --> 02:47.020
I wish you well.

03:25.960 --> 03:27.020
What are you doing?

03:27.900 --> 03:29.320
We are going to Beijing.

03:29.560 --> 03:31.290
What do you need these bugs for?

03:33.079 --> 03:33.680
Didn't I say

03:33.680 --> 03:35.079
not to rent out the house?

03:37.000 --> 03:38.800
I'm doing this for your own good.

03:39.310 --> 03:40.910
If I'm there to take care of you,

03:40.910 --> 03:43.110
you'll be able to focus on your studies.

03:44.590 --> 03:45.430
You are just fulfilling

03:45.430 --> 03:46.760
your own expectations.

03:48.170 --> 03:49.990
I raised you all by myself.

03:50.090 --> 03:51.370
I lived frugally.

03:51.400 --> 03:53.120
My only wish was for you
to make something of yourself

03:53.120 --> 03:55.140
and never be looked down on.

03:55.310 --> 03:56.190
Saying that,

03:56.380 --> 03:56.960
where is your conscience?

03:56.960 --> 03:58.310
Stop talking.

03:59.250 --> 04:00.990
I've heard enough of this.

04:02.790 --> 04:04.670
You only care about my grades.

04:04.700 --> 04:05.360
You have never

04:05.360 --> 04:06.590
cared about how I feel.

04:06.590 --> 04:07.360
Where did

04:07.360 --> 04:08.120
these wounds

04:08.120 --> 04:09.720
and these clothes come from?

04:10.470 --> 04:11.530
When I'm out there,

04:11.910 --> 04:14.080
I am looked down upon.

04:14.840 --> 04:16.339
No matter how hard I try...

04:16.510 --> 04:17.720
No matter how hard I try,

04:17.720 --> 04:18.269
in others' eyes,

04:18.269 --> 04:20.070
I'm just an illegitimate child.

04:23.010 --> 04:24.210
Jiang Yan, you...

04:36.909 --> 04:38.770
If you're an illegitimate child,

04:39.040 --> 04:40.560
then what am I?

04:41.080 --> 04:42.930
What do I have in this life?

04:43.270 --> 04:44.720
I only have you.

04:44.720 --> 04:46.159
Only you.

04:54.120 --> 04:54.800
Yan.

04:55.440 --> 04:56.840
Yan, where are you going?

04:57.390 --> 04:58.880
Yan, where are you going?

05:03.510 --> 05:04.310
Jiang Yan!

05:08.390 --> 05:10.120
Jiang Yan!

05:30.180 --> 05:31.580
Come on, bro, have a seat.

05:36.950 --> 05:38.570
Why did you only get 3 bottles?

05:38.570 --> 05:39.240
Bro,

05:39.450 --> 05:40.520
we're out of money.

05:42.040 --> 05:43.460
Why are we out of money?

05:43.830 --> 05:45.090
Why are we out of money?

05:45.120 --> 05:46.240
I asked you to catch someone,

05:46.240 --> 05:47.390
and you just couldn't do it.

05:47.390 --> 05:48.390
A bunch of losers.

06:01.800 --> 06:02.310
Bro,

06:02.830 --> 06:03.760
you hit someone?

06:04.030 --> 06:05.030
Don't I already look like an idiot?

06:05.030 --> 06:06.030
No, no, no.

06:06.360 --> 06:08.290
I mean your bottle cap hit someone.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.130
What are you looking at?

06:11.680 --> 06:14.080
I'm talking to you.
What are you looking at?

06:16.830 --> 06:18.160
What are you looking at?

06:18.480 --> 06:20.240
Bro, bro.

06:21.770 --> 06:24.100
He seems to be a friend
of that little liar.

06:30.090 --> 06:32.159
The top student behind that little liar.

06:32.159 --> 06:32.960
That's right.

06:36.800 --> 06:37.730
Mr. Straight-A.

06:38.920 --> 06:40.750
Even Mr. Straight-A drinks?

06:43.080 --> 06:44.300
You are not good enough for her.

06:44.300 --> 06:45.630
She ran away with Lu Xixiao

06:45.630 --> 06:47.360
a long time ago.

06:49.480 --> 06:49.950
Come on.

06:50.390 --> 06:51.000
Cheers.

06:53.390 --> 06:54.310
Who said that?

07:09.080 --> 07:09.870
I did.

07:10.510 --> 07:11.310
Got a problem?

07:17.830 --> 07:19.120
She is back.

07:19.870 --> 07:21.400
She returned to Pingchuan.

07:25.720 --> 07:27.120
But even if she's back,

07:28.040 --> 07:29.270
so what?

07:33.090 --> 07:34.620
I'm not good enough for her.

07:37.159 --> 07:38.310
She's back.

07:38.330 --> 07:39.490
She's back?

07:42.070 --> 07:43.600
I'm not good enough for her.

07:49.310 --> 07:50.510
Come on, let's drink.

07:51.000 --> 07:51.930
Mr. Straight-A.

07:52.770 --> 07:53.700
Mr. Straight-A.

07:55.770 --> 07:56.870
She's back.

08:06.450 --> 08:07.290
She's back.

08:07.920 --> 08:08.580
She's back.

08:24.800 --> 08:26.280
Go away! Help!

08:26.490 --> 08:27.360
Let's go! Hurry!

08:27.360 --> 08:28.000
Help!

08:34.150 --> 08:35.210
What do you want?

08:35.230 --> 08:35.919
So noisy!

08:36.179 --> 08:37.039
Help!

08:37.070 --> 08:38.110
Help!

08:38.140 --> 08:38.720
Help!

08:38.720 --> 08:39.320
Zhou Wan.

08:39.840 --> 08:40.870
You forced me to do this.

08:40.870 --> 08:42.390
Help!

09:15.030 --> 09:16.030
You're awake,

09:16.030 --> 09:17.910
little liar.

09:20.070 --> 09:21.180
Perfect.

09:21.870 --> 09:23.080
Let's talk business.

09:24.720 --> 09:25.630
Let me go.

09:27.040 --> 09:28.160
What do you want?

09:28.310 --> 09:29.300
We can talk.

09:32.150 --> 09:33.350
What did you just say?

09:34.480 --> 09:35.280
What was that?

09:36.270 --> 09:37.320
What do you want?

09:38.200 --> 09:39.360
What do I want?

09:43.910 --> 09:45.630
Do you think I'd believe you?

09:47.080 --> 09:48.600
You and Lu Xixiao

09:49.510 --> 09:51.570
really screwed me over.

09:52.000 --> 09:53.320
Nice going.

09:54.120 --> 09:55.700
You made me lose my job,

09:55.720 --> 09:58.070
my boss,

09:58.420 --> 10:00.400
and left me drowning in debt.

10:04.160 --> 10:05.100
Lu Xixiao.

10:05.670 --> 10:06.200
I can give you

10:06.200 --> 10:07.120
all my money.

10:07.120 --> 10:08.200
Phone. Phone.

10:08.220 --> 10:08.860
Luo He.

10:11.030 --> 10:11.720
Lu Xixiao.

10:14.390 --> 10:17.720
The shy rose

10:17.740 --> 10:20.460
blooms quietly.

10:22.850 --> 10:23.560
Look.

10:27.320 --> 10:28.240
What should I do?

10:28.240 --> 10:29.170
What should I do?

10:48.030 --> 10:49.360
Hello? What's wrong?

10:51.070 --> 10:51.870
Where are you?

10:57.240 --> 10:58.120
Hello.

10:58.480 --> 11:00.960
Xixiao.

11:01.270 --> 11:04.030
Long time no see.

11:05.240 --> 11:06.240
Where is Zhou Wan?

11:07.510 --> 11:08.580
Come to

11:09.240 --> 11:10.840
the address

11:10.840 --> 11:12.240
I'll send you later.

11:12.540 --> 11:13.790
Come alone.

11:14.270 --> 11:16.670
Otherwise, your little girlfriend

11:16.750 --> 11:18.840
is going to cry miserably.

11:20.380 --> 11:21.210
Where is she?

11:22.260 --> 11:23.270
Don't believe me?

11:24.440 --> 11:25.700
He doesn't believe it.

11:26.680 --> 11:28.670
Come on, say something.

11:32.380 --> 11:33.320
Let me tell you,

11:33.320 --> 11:34.250
you little liar.

11:35.200 --> 11:36.790
If he doesn't come,

11:36.910 --> 11:38.790
you'll suffer.

11:40.190 --> 11:41.520
Come on, say something.

11:45.790 --> 11:47.720
Say something.

11:47.880 --> 11:48.390
Luo He.

11:48.390 --> 11:49.390
If you dare lay a finger on her today,

11:49.390 --> 11:50.920
you're dead, you know that?

11:53.690 --> 11:54.550
Say something!

11:57.750 --> 11:58.670
Zhou Wan.

11:59.240 --> 12:00.170
Don't come over.

12:00.380 --> 12:01.540
I told you to speak, but you wouldn't.

12:01.540 --> 12:03.140
Luo He, you're asking for it.

12:03.360 --> 12:04.750
Don't be so angry.

12:04.750 --> 12:05.550
Xixiao.

12:06.340 --> 12:07.440
Come alone to the address

12:07.440 --> 12:08.320
I'll send you.

12:08.320 --> 12:09.370
Lu Xixiao!

12:09.440 --> 12:11.910
I don't have that much patience.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.630
When I told you to speak,

12:20.630 --> 12:21.480
you wouldn't.

12:21.480 --> 12:23.540
I told you to speak, and you wouldn't.

12:40.240 --> 12:41.870
Here he comes.

12:41.870 --> 12:42.480
Don't move.

12:42.480 --> 12:43.200
Zhou Wan.

12:43.670 --> 12:44.270
-Zhou Wan!
-Don’t move.

12:44.270 --> 12:45.360
-Come on.
-Zhou Wan.

12:45.360 --> 12:45.960
Zhou Wan.

12:46.480 --> 12:47.270
Zhou Wan!

12:48.150 --> 12:49.270
Don't move, don't move.

12:49.270 --> 12:50.080
Zhou Wan.

12:50.100 --> 12:51.260
Lu Xixiao.

12:53.760 --> 12:55.330
Go on. Move.

12:55.720 --> 12:56.760
Come on. Come on.

12:56.780 --> 12:57.840
Put the knife down.

12:57.880 --> 12:58.550
Come on.

13:06.370 --> 13:07.010
Move.

13:08.310 --> 13:08.940
Go ahead.

13:09.010 --> 13:10.300
Come on, try again.

13:10.870 --> 13:11.550
Try it.

13:12.760 --> 13:13.290
Come on.

13:15.360 --> 13:16.050
Not moving anymore?

13:16.050 --> 13:16.910
Being good now?

13:19.210 --> 13:19.730
Come on.

13:22.790 --> 13:23.360
Xu Feng.

13:23.810 --> 13:24.610
The metal bar.

13:27.960 --> 13:30.150
-You really care about her.
-It's okay.

13:30.150 --> 13:31.630
-You still love her so much.
-It's okay.

13:31.630 --> 13:32.390
I'm fine.

13:39.350 --> 13:40.250
No!

13:43.340 --> 13:44.070
You're here.

13:45.130 --> 13:46.410
You really came.

13:48.440 --> 13:49.840
What exactly do you want?

13:51.440 --> 13:52.160
Kneel.

13:54.410 --> 13:55.440
-Kneel!
-He said to kneel.

13:55.440 --> 13:56.370
-Kneel!
-Kneel!

13:56.640 --> 13:57.890
Don't do it, Lu Xixiao.

13:57.890 --> 13:58.550
Kneel down.

13:58.870 --> 14:00.050
He told you to kneel.

14:02.060 --> 14:03.450
You two.

14:03.830 --> 14:05.660
Both of you.

14:05.690 --> 14:07.640
One keeps making trouble for me.

14:07.670 --> 14:09.530
The other cuts off my livelihood.

14:09.670 --> 14:11.130
Are you ever going to stop?

14:12.450 --> 14:13.170
Kneel.

14:17.670 --> 14:18.880
Don't kneel.

14:20.230 --> 14:20.700
Hurry.

14:21.050 --> 14:22.030
Kneel down right now.

14:22.030 --> 14:22.820
Fine.

14:24.330 --> 14:25.660
You won't kneel, right?

14:38.070 --> 14:39.880
Kneel before me.

14:43.830 --> 14:44.990
Or else,

14:45.950 --> 14:48.010
I can't guarantee what happens next.

15:10.200 --> 15:10.960
No.

15:11.290 --> 15:12.380
No!

15:13.360 --> 15:14.320
Lu Xixiao.

15:15.930 --> 15:16.800
He knelt.

15:18.500 --> 15:19.300
No!

15:23.870 --> 15:25.120
No.

15:29.320 --> 15:30.120
No!

15:35.490 --> 15:36.510
Shut up!

15:36.760 --> 15:38.890
Whatever you've got, take it out on me!

15:39.440 --> 15:41.110
I will. I will.

15:41.810 --> 15:43.000
No, Lu Xixiao.

15:43.030 --> 15:44.150
Stand up.

15:45.060 --> 15:46.050
Lu Xixiao.

15:46.550 --> 15:48.090
Look at you now.

15:50.390 --> 15:51.030
The phone.

15:52.420 --> 15:53.480
Stay on your knees.

15:59.230 --> 16:00.790
Lu Xixiao, stand up.

16:01.510 --> 16:01.970
Come on.

16:02.490 --> 16:04.020
Straighten your body a bit.

16:06.200 --> 16:07.730
Come on, kneel up straight.

16:07.910 --> 16:09.240
Keep your hands in place.

16:09.240 --> 16:10.790
Keep your mouth shut.

16:10.790 --> 16:12.390
Open your eyes wide.

16:14.550 --> 16:15.150
Good, good.

16:15.150 --> 16:17.080
Yes, just like this, with red eyes.

16:25.610 --> 16:27.660
How is it?

16:29.630 --> 16:30.790
What should the title be?

16:30.790 --> 16:32.080
Are you satisfied?

16:33.770 --> 16:34.530
Let her go.

16:35.610 --> 16:37.410
Let me come up with a title first.

16:37.690 --> 16:39.440
How about we write the title as

16:40.160 --> 16:42.360
"Lu Xixiao Kneels and Kowtows Like a Dog

16:42.360 --> 16:44.230
to Apologize"?

16:44.260 --> 16:45.560
How is this title?

16:46.040 --> 16:47.170
This is pretty good.

16:47.380 --> 16:48.270
Like a dog.

16:48.270 --> 16:49.220
I think it's pretty good too.

16:49.220 --> 16:50.220
What do you think?

16:50.630 --> 16:51.490
Say something.

16:52.210 --> 16:54.070
Say something! What do you think?

17:04.690 --> 17:05.410
You two

17:06.700 --> 17:07.849
sure have guts.

17:09.589 --> 17:10.589
But sorry,

17:11.440 --> 17:13.700
I specialize in dealing with tough guys.

17:14.440 --> 17:15.069
Today,

17:15.069 --> 17:16.480
either you break a leg,

17:17.609 --> 17:19.230
or she breaks an arm.

17:21.550 --> 17:22.440
Come after me.

17:22.440 --> 17:23.410
Leave her alone.

17:24.349 --> 17:25.349
Luo He.

17:31.300 --> 17:32.450
I might rip your arm off.

17:32.450 --> 17:33.460
Choose.

17:33.640 --> 17:34.660
Do whatever you want with me.

17:34.660 --> 17:36.220
Come after me.

17:48.750 --> 17:50.140
I'll stab you to death!

18:22.240 --> 18:23.010
It's okay.

18:23.110 --> 18:24.350
It's okay. It's okay.

18:24.710 --> 18:25.450
It's okay.

18:27.200 --> 18:27.800
It's okay.

18:27.870 --> 18:29.410
It's okay. It's okay.

18:30.740 --> 18:31.710
It's okay.

18:34.000 --> 18:34.880
Lu Xixiao.

18:34.880 --> 18:35.510
It's okay.

18:36.310 --> 18:37.310
It's okay.

18:39.360 --> 18:40.120
Don't worry.

18:43.480 --> 18:44.110
It's okay.

18:44.480 --> 18:45.200
It's okay.

18:47.180 --> 18:47.860
It's okay.

18:53.280 --> 18:54.310
Lu Xixiao.

18:55.160 --> 18:56.060
Lu Xixiao.

19:10.680 --> 19:12.440
Somebody!

19:12.460 --> 19:13.910
Help!

19:16.030 --> 19:18.000
Somebody!

19:20.400 --> 19:23.640
Lu Xixiao!

19:33.480 --> 19:34.550
Team One, secure the scene.

19:34.550 --> 19:35.480
Team Two, secure the perimeter.

19:35.480 --> 19:36.480
-Yes, sir.
-Yes, sir.

19:36.480 --> 19:37.350
Quick, save them.

19:37.350 --> 19:38.950
Stretcher and first aid kit!

19:39.290 --> 19:42.490
Call the hospital.
Tell them to prepare for an emergency.

20:20.850 --> 20:22.050
How is the situation?

20:23.090 --> 20:23.720
Dad.

20:34.200 --> 20:35.130
It's okay now.

20:42.110 --> 20:43.310
How is the situation?

20:44.240 --> 20:45.710
I am asking you!

20:52.510 --> 20:53.550
Is this the outcome

20:53.550 --> 20:55.310
you wanted?

21:11.270 --> 21:12.590
You are still a kid.

21:13.560 --> 21:14.320
I suppose

21:14.540 --> 21:16.670
you didn't want this to happen either.

21:17.550 --> 21:18.830
Xixiao chose to go.

21:19.720 --> 21:21.530
That was his decision.

21:27.510 --> 21:28.920
When Xixiao was little,

21:29.240 --> 21:30.680
he was a very good boy.

21:31.350 --> 21:32.280
Unfortunately,

21:33.140 --> 21:35.010
too many things happened later,

21:35.510 --> 21:37.170
and his personality changed.

21:38.680 --> 21:40.000
But it's all because

21:40.000 --> 21:41.530
he lost too much in the past,

21:41.920 --> 21:43.650
so he didn't dare to take anyone

21:43.700 --> 21:45.500
or anything too seriously.

21:54.750 --> 21:56.540
Until he met you.

21:57.410 --> 21:58.630
I can tell

21:59.350 --> 22:01.150
that Xixiao likes you very much.

22:01.720 --> 22:04.160
You are different to him.

22:06.290 --> 22:07.900
And because of that,

22:08.750 --> 22:10.730
I am telling you this.

22:12.410 --> 22:14.130
Xixiao is different from you.

22:14.750 --> 22:15.590
He's a Lu.

22:16.550 --> 22:17.310
So,

22:17.880 --> 22:19.160
the things you did

22:19.570 --> 22:20.400
will ultimately

22:20.400 --> 22:22.690
only put him in a very passive position.

22:23.650 --> 22:25.500
If he hadn't met you,

22:26.020 --> 22:27.420
he might never have had to

22:28.020 --> 22:30.230
face this situation in his life.

22:32.920 --> 22:33.770
I know

22:34.880 --> 22:36.070
Xixiao's father

22:36.070 --> 22:37.530
has already talked to you.

22:38.880 --> 22:40.340
You didn't give an answer.

22:43.120 --> 22:45.410
Now I am here to talk to you.

22:46.140 --> 22:47.110
It is not a deal,

22:47.860 --> 22:49.130
but a request.

22:50.140 --> 22:51.600
As his grandpa,

22:52.640 --> 22:54.240
I beg you not to disrupt

22:54.260 --> 22:56.790
the smooth-sailing life
he was meant to have.

22:59.250 --> 23:00.490
Promise me,

23:00.830 --> 23:02.070
leave Xixiao.

23:04.400 --> 23:05.970
Promise me.

23:11.200 --> 23:13.530
As soon as Lu Xixiao is safely discharged,

23:16.270 --> 23:17.070
I will leave.

23:24.350 --> 23:25.880
Make it as soon as possible.

23:26.750 --> 23:27.590
The Lu family spent

23:27.590 --> 23:29.390
so much effort cultivating him.

23:30.610 --> 23:31.790
It's not for him

23:31.980 --> 23:33.840
to live this kind of life with you.

23:37.920 --> 23:38.880
I'm sorry.

23:46.640 --> 23:48.520
I was too selfish.

23:52.530 --> 23:54.160
I've caused you trouble.

23:57.160 --> 23:58.960
Dad, the surgery is over.

23:59.000 --> 24:00.270
Xixiao has been taken to the ward.

24:00.270 --> 24:01.550
The doctor said
once the anesthesia wears off,

24:01.550 --> 24:02.520
he will wake up.

24:02.680 --> 24:03.270
Good.

24:03.440 --> 24:04.550
Take me to see him. Hurry!

24:04.550 --> 24:04.960
Okay.

24:05.030 --> 24:05.640
Qilan.

24:06.070 --> 24:07.400
You must not let any outsiders

24:07.400 --> 24:08.160
disturb him.

25:15.070 --> 25:16.310
If anything happens to him,

25:16.310 --> 25:18.000
let me know right away.

25:18.030 --> 25:19.240
My father is in poor health.

25:19.240 --> 25:20.480
He can't handle such turmoil.

25:20.480 --> 25:21.350
I've got my hands full

25:21.350 --> 25:22.310
for now.

25:22.510 --> 25:23.200
During this time,

25:23.200 --> 25:25.040
I'll trouble you to take care of Xixiao.

25:25.040 --> 25:26.340
Don't worry.

25:26.400 --> 25:27.640
From now on, I'll keep a close eye on him.

25:27.640 --> 25:28.400
Okay, no need to see us out.

25:28.400 --> 25:29.000
We're leaving.

25:29.000 --> 25:29.590
Okay.

25:34.640 --> 25:35.440
Ms. Chen.

25:38.570 --> 25:39.440
Miss Zhou.

25:40.020 --> 25:41.820
It's not that I won't help you.

25:42.270 --> 25:44.190
Mr. Lu Sr. and Ms. Qilan

25:44.220 --> 25:45.810
specifically told me

25:46.030 --> 25:48.430
not to let outsiders into the ward.

25:48.670 --> 25:49.920
Could I please ask you

25:50.350 --> 25:51.950
to bring the chicken soup in?

25:52.250 --> 25:54.110
This way, when Lu Xixiao wakes up,

25:54.120 --> 25:55.980
he'll have some hot soup to drink.

25:56.930 --> 25:57.940
No problem.

25:57.970 --> 25:59.500
-Leave it to me.
-Thank you.

26:00.070 --> 26:00.790
Thank you.

26:01.480 --> 26:02.680
Sorry to trouble you.

26:09.310 --> 26:10.820
[Keep Noise Down] [Quiet]

26:12.110 --> 26:13.030
I'll get it.

26:13.650 --> 26:14.500
I'll do it.

26:20.750 --> 26:21.950
Be careful, it's hot.

26:22.940 --> 26:23.710
[Keep Noise Down] [Quiet]

26:24.000 --> 26:25.570
[Keep Noise Down] [Quiet]

26:34.940 --> 26:36.600
It's time to change the IV bag.

26:36.970 --> 26:38.480
I didn't press the call button.

26:38.480 --> 26:39.680
It was the girl out there

26:39.680 --> 26:40.810
who reminded me.

26:47.320 --> 26:48.410
Excuse me.

26:48.850 --> 26:50.210
How is he?

26:50.240 --> 26:51.500
He hasn't woken up yet.

27:10.440 --> 27:12.410
The doctor said Xixiao is much better.

27:12.410 --> 27:13.810
You can go in and see him.

27:58.910 --> 28:01.370
This is the first time
I've seen you so quiet.

28:03.690 --> 28:05.520
I'm really not used to it.

28:09.170 --> 28:10.610
Luo He has been arrested.

28:12.140 --> 28:15.130
The police said he faces criminal charges

28:15.870 --> 28:18.130
and might be sentenced to several years.

28:19.030 --> 28:20.400
He won't have another chance

28:20.400 --> 28:22.130
to cause me trouble ever again.

28:36.720 --> 28:37.960
I'm sorry.

28:39.310 --> 28:40.900
It's all because of me.

28:54.330 --> 28:59.490
[Outpatient Clinic; Outpatient Building]

29:58.640 --> 29:59.690
You're awake.

30:06.890 --> 30:08.020
Take this off for me.

30:19.240 --> 30:20.960
You were sleeping so soundly.

30:24.110 --> 30:25.770
I'll go get the doctor for you.

30:26.100 --> 30:26.780
No need.

30:27.960 --> 30:30.090
I just want to stay with you for a while.

30:35.450 --> 30:36.380
I'm hungry.

30:39.240 --> 30:41.040
I brought you some chicken soup.

30:42.670 --> 30:44.440
But it might have cooled down a bit.

30:44.440 --> 30:45.070
How about I go back

30:45.070 --> 30:46.200
and heat it up again?

30:46.590 --> 30:47.350
No need.

30:48.570 --> 30:49.490
Give it to me.

31:22.900 --> 31:24.980
Mr. Lu, Ms. Qilan, you're both here.

31:25.680 --> 31:27.270
The doctor said the surgery
was very successful,

31:27.270 --> 31:28.310
and he's fine,

31:28.380 --> 31:30.200
so they took all the equipment away.

31:30.200 --> 31:31.260
That's good.

31:33.330 --> 31:33.860
You...

31:35.420 --> 31:36.280
Sorry.

31:36.380 --> 31:37.380
I'll go out now.

31:38.670 --> 31:39.610
Why are you...

31:40.750 --> 31:41.720
You kid,

31:41.720 --> 31:42.920
why are you so spoiled?

31:42.920 --> 31:44.000
One person's not enough for you?

31:44.000 --> 31:44.920
You need two?

31:47.890 --> 31:49.840
I'm a patient now.

31:50.720 --> 31:52.110
Even if I asked for ten,

31:54.370 --> 31:55.850
Grandpa would agree.

31:58.100 --> 31:59.400
I think even if you had

31:59.400 --> 32:00.070
a hundred,

32:00.070 --> 32:01.620
they wouldn't be
as satisfying as this one.

32:01.620 --> 32:02.250
Dad,

32:02.640 --> 32:03.920
you see, Xixiao got injured

32:03.920 --> 32:04.750
because of Zhou Wan.

32:04.750 --> 32:06.160
It's only right for her

32:06.160 --> 32:07.960
to come over and take care of him.

32:08.490 --> 32:10.400
You really make me worry.

32:12.730 --> 32:13.380
Fine.

32:14.170 --> 32:16.270
As long as you can get better
as soon as possible,

32:16.270 --> 32:19.000
you can do whatever you want.

32:19.410 --> 32:20.320
Ms. Chen,

32:20.920 --> 32:22.310
take the nutritional supplements

32:22.310 --> 32:23.330
we brought from home.

32:23.330 --> 32:24.810
Keep an eye on him

32:24.960 --> 32:26.620
and make sure he eats them all.

32:27.730 --> 32:28.330
Qilan,

32:29.400 --> 32:30.110
let's go.

32:38.350 --> 32:39.590
I'll go help Ms. Chen.

32:49.200 --> 32:51.600
I'm not used to the food
at Grandpa's house.

32:53.130 --> 32:55.060
I still want to drink chicken soup.

33:09.390 --> 33:10.520
Sit here and feed me.

33:27.280 --> 33:28.040
Zhou Wan.

33:34.380 --> 33:36.580
You have to take responsibility for me.

34:12.949 --> 34:13.679
Zhou Wan.

34:14.520 --> 34:16.380
We've already talked about this.

34:16.440 --> 34:17.969
I asked you to leave Xixiao,

34:18.280 --> 34:19.360
and you agreed.

34:19.570 --> 34:21.429
Why aren't you keeping your word?

34:22.060 --> 34:23.260
I haven't forgotten.

34:26.750 --> 34:28.389
But can I just wait

34:29.510 --> 34:31.440
until he is completely recovered?

34:32.510 --> 34:34.040
The longer this drags on,

34:34.179 --> 34:35.639
the more damage it will do.

34:35.889 --> 34:37.560
You're a smart girl.

34:37.840 --> 34:39.710
You must understand this.

34:39.730 --> 34:40.650
I beg you.

34:42.020 --> 34:43.620
Just until he's discharged.

34:45.510 --> 34:46.350
Please.

34:48.120 --> 34:49.270
I am begging you.

34:50.510 --> 34:51.679
I apologize to you.

34:53.650 --> 34:54.400
I'm sorry.

34:56.280 --> 34:57.400
I beg of you.

34:59.710 --> 35:01.040
Until he's discharged.

35:08.050 --> 35:11.000
[Inpatient Building]

35:10.670 --> 35:12.230
I made all this according

35:12.230 --> 35:13.630
to the doctor's instructions.

35:13.630 --> 35:14.320
Eat more,

35:14.320 --> 35:15.780
so you can recover faster.

35:28.440 --> 35:29.170
You're here.

35:31.760 --> 35:32.760
Time to eat.

35:35.080 --> 35:37.740
I was about to starve to death
if you didn't come.

35:41.600 --> 35:43.130
Does your wound still hurt?

35:44.480 --> 35:46.410
It stopped hurting a long time ago.

35:47.030 --> 35:47.760
Really?

35:47.920 --> 35:48.590
Really.

35:48.610 --> 35:49.520
You're not lying to me?

35:49.520 --> 35:50.620
I'm not.

35:50.910 --> 35:52.310
Beef with broccoli,

35:52.350 --> 35:54.120
zucchini with eggs,

35:54.140 --> 35:56.810
and king oyster mushrooms with meat.

35:56.830 --> 35:57.860
So bland.

35:59.250 --> 36:00.620
You don't like them?

36:01.670 --> 36:02.850
Of course not.

36:02.950 --> 36:04.480
I love everything you make.

36:10.070 --> 36:10.970
How is it?

36:13.490 --> 36:14.550
Then eat more.

36:16.170 --> 36:17.080
Feed me a bite.

36:18.070 --> 36:19.530
I'm afraid this will drop.

36:19.870 --> 36:20.800
Open your mouth.

36:25.000 --> 36:25.480
Done.

36:25.480 --> 36:26.550
If you feel unwell,

36:26.550 --> 36:27.630
tell us anytime.

36:43.630 --> 36:44.500
Hello,

36:44.590 --> 36:45.560
who is this?

37:16.030 --> 37:17.060
Eat.

37:22.600 --> 37:24.530
Help me eat some. I can't finish it.

37:24.970 --> 37:26.780
I prepared this for you.

37:33.920 --> 37:35.070
I knew it.

37:37.060 --> 37:37.680
Here.

37:39.440 --> 37:40.610
Which one do you want?

37:40.610 --> 37:41.610
Anything is fine.

38:02.370 --> 38:04.310
I'm begging you. Promise me

38:04.440 --> 38:05.780
you'll leave Xixiao.

38:06.530 --> 38:08.870
If you keep getting entangled
with him like this,

38:08.870 --> 38:10.400
it will only ruin Xixiao.

38:10.980 --> 38:12.270
He should have had

38:12.290 --> 38:13.770
a smooth-sailing life.

38:15.810 --> 38:17.150
Promise me.

38:18.330 --> 38:21.170
Leave Xixiao when he gets better.

38:40.090 --> 38:41.130
Lu Xixiao.

38:42.320 --> 38:44.150
I don't know how much longer

38:45.110 --> 38:46.910
I'll be able to stay by your side.

38:51.710 --> 38:53.510
You've almost fully recovered.

38:53.760 --> 38:56.070
You can be discharged in a couple of days.

38:56.230 --> 38:57.690
After you're discharged,

38:57.960 --> 38:59.380
you still need to rest

38:59.620 --> 39:01.280
and avoid strenuous exercise

39:01.720 --> 39:03.590
so your wound doesn't tear open.

39:05.600 --> 39:07.040
Get some good rest.

39:07.930 --> 39:08.990
Thank you, doctor.

39:10.770 --> 39:11.610
Doctor.

39:12.310 --> 39:14.250
Are you sure he's fully recovered?

39:14.410 --> 39:15.360
Does he need another

39:15.360 --> 39:16.820
full-body checkup or something?

39:16.820 --> 39:17.380
Checkup?

39:17.410 --> 39:19.390
Didn't he just have one a few days ago?

39:19.390 --> 39:20.470
Don't worry.

39:20.770 --> 39:21.640
He's a strong

39:21.670 --> 39:22.080
and healthy young man,

39:22.080 --> 39:23.240
so he recovers quickly.

39:23.240 --> 39:23.990
Don't worry.

39:25.490 --> 39:26.390
Thank you, doctor.

39:26.390 --> 39:26.970
You're welcome.

39:26.970 --> 39:28.180
Thank you so much.

39:31.350 --> 39:31.980
What?

39:32.640 --> 39:34.370
Don't want me to be discharged?

39:38.110 --> 39:39.480
I'm just worried.

39:41.490 --> 39:42.740
What is there to worry about?

39:42.740 --> 39:43.890
I happen to miss Xiaoliu anyway.

39:43.890 --> 39:44.810
I'll go see it.

39:45.820 --> 39:47.740
What good food did you make today?

39:49.850 --> 39:51.040
I asked the doctor.

39:51.070 --> 39:53.890
He said you don't have to follow
a strict diet anymore.

39:53.890 --> 39:57.400
I specially prepared this for you.

39:58.350 --> 40:00.150
Noodles with Three Delicacies.

40:01.360 --> 40:02.190
I thought I wouldn't get to eat this

40:02.190 --> 40:03.520
until I was discharged.

40:06.360 --> 40:07.410
Let me feed you.

40:07.840 --> 40:09.070
It's fine. I can do it.

40:20.280 --> 40:21.610
It's the same as before.

40:25.330 --> 40:27.990
Come pick me up
when I'm discharged in a few days.

40:35.540 --> 40:37.340
Why did you only buy one portion?

40:38.280 --> 40:39.150
I'm not hungry.

40:39.400 --> 40:40.460
I don't want to eat.

40:41.230 --> 40:42.430
When I'm discharged,

40:42.480 --> 40:43.440
move in with me.

40:44.290 --> 40:45.490
When I'm a bit better,

40:46.840 --> 40:47.950
I'll talk to Grandpa.

40:47.950 --> 40:49.350
We'll go back to Yicheng.

40:58.280 --> 41:00.680
Let's discuss it after you're discharged.

41:01.670 --> 41:02.320
I want to eat

41:02.320 --> 41:03.670
the bread downstairs.

41:03.690 --> 41:05.280
I haven't had it in a long time.

41:05.280 --> 41:06.280
Before you're discharged,

41:06.280 --> 41:07.280
I'll go buy some.

41:09.410 --> 41:10.380
Wait for me.
